                            "Ireland"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1978a366-397b-49cc-8462-9a2a93e7f5a9",
                                "sense_id": "c537b525-5d64-3620-94d1-069bd62afe22",
                                "text": "The colonnade above him made him think vaguely of an ancient temple and the ashplant on which he leaned wearily of the curved stick of an augur. / He began to beat the frayed end of his ashplant against the base of a pillar."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5a515cf-0eda-41bf-82e3-1cf673114eff",
                                "sense_id": "c537b525-5d64-3620-94d1-069bd62afe22",
                                "text": "She look her hat, and ashplant, and left them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dda10c27-7561-4703-85e2-e4b431c48ae8",
                                "sense_id": "c537b525-5d64-3620-94d1-069bd62afe22",
                                "text": "\"She'll do,\" said Kelly and tapped his ash-plant / Across her hindquarters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3f7bf9d-1fa3-4b2f-ab7f-2a4339316c74",
                                "sense_id": "c537b525-5d64-3620-94d1-069bd62afe22",
                                "text": "Unconscious of their bulging eyes, he pounded on the door of the mayor's house with the knob of his ashplant."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a3bcc58-c202-3dd2-b60c-172955aa30a2",
                        "entry_id": "137c582a-c633-3f45-b5a1-f32828ea212e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A cane for administering corporal punishment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da1dcdd8-e787-48d9-b7b9-2a05a551145f",
                                "sense_id": "3a3bcc58-c202-3dd2-b60c-172955aa30a2",
                                "text": "Bob Cherry bent over and touched his toes. The ashplant swished and swished."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
